Hi Carlos,

The Rattle GUI does not currently support xgboost - it is planned.

Nonetheless I added a dispatch to ggVarImp() to support xgboost models. This is useful if independently of Rattle you build an xgboost model and want to plot the variable importance with ggVarImp(model). Something I had cause to use recently.

Hopefully we will have xgboost supported in Rattle soon.

Regards,
Graham

